    "message": "Move test_care_lifecycle.py under tests/unit/domain\n\nOnly the file move, named after the module most of it tests\n(domain/care_receipts.py), so its history stays traceable. The next\ncommit splits out its day-long run and switches the generated\nScenario tests to the shared fixture (#88).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
