    "message": "Check generated care needs and a care day on the shared Scenario\n\nTwo tests built their own Scenario with InitialScenarioBuilder: one to\ncheck that operator care-need rates reach the preview's population\ncontext and the runtime (seed 73, 4 adults), one to run a whole day\nwith care receipts (seed 1, 8 adults). They now pass the same form\nfields to generated_scenario_with and generated_previews (#88); the\nday-long run still checks that the preview can start.\n\nThe day-long run moves to tests/integration/test_care_lifecycle.py.\nThe hand-driven care receipt unit tests keep their small fixture and\nare only formatted, which also wraps lines that were too long.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
